  "name": "Kent Hotel Istanbul",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "578426"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "A stay at Kent Hotel Istanbul places you in the heart of Istanbul, within a 15-minute walk of Grand Bazaar and S\u00FCleymaniye Mosque.  This family-friendly hotel is 1.1 mi (1.7 km) from Blue Mosque and 1.6 mi (2.5 km) from Hagia Sophia."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 94 guestrooms featuring minibars and LCD televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Bathrooms have designer toiletries and bidets. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take in the views from a garden and make use of amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access and concierge services. Additional features at this hotel include a television in a common area and a banquet hall. Getting to nearby attractions is a breeze with the area shuttle (surcharge)."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EBeyazit Square - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Grand Bazaar - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul University - 0.9 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Column of Constantine - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E S\u00FCleymaniye Mosque - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Turkish and Islamic Art Museum - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sultanahmet Square - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Basilica Cistern - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Egyptian Bazaar - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Little Hagia Sophia - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E G\u00FClhane Park - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Fatih Mosque - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Emin\u00F6n\u00FC Square - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hagia Sophia - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Blue Mosque - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 44.4 km / 27.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Airport (IST) - 45.7 km / 28.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Kent Hotel Istanbul is Istanbul Airport (IST). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher and a security system\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E   \u003Cli\u003EOne child 2 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in and contactless check-out are available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Stop by the hotel\u0027s restaurant, CALCEDOINE, for lunch or dinner. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and 24-hour room service is provided. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Continental breakfasts are available daily from 4:00 AM to 1:00 PM for a fee."
    }
  ],
